        <body>
            <div xml:id="d430-a2">

                <pb facs="0592" n="486" sameAs="frus:frus1906p1/pg486"/>

                <head>[Inclosure 2—Translation.]</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Office of the Presidency.</hi></placeName></dateline></opener>
                <p>The president of the house of representatives informs the President of the
                    Republic that in session had on the 14th instant it approved the resolution
                    adopted by the senate adjourning the extraordinary session called for that
                    day.</p>
                <p>Which, by order of the President, is published for the information of the
                    public.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Jorge A. Belt</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Secretary to the President.</hi></signed>
                    <lb/>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Habana</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1906-09-15"><hi rendition="#italic">September 15,
                        1906</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
